{"total": 39.316, "lines": [{"cap": "If smoking on planes is banned… why does the bathroom have an ashtray?", "start": 0.36, "end": 3.761, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 3.641416, "words": [{"text": "If", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.456}, {"text": "smoking", "start": 0.468, "end": 0.841}, {"text": "on", "start": 0.853, "end": 0.961}, {"text": "planes", "start": 0.973, "end": 1.322}, {"text": "is", "start": 1.334, "end": 1.442}, {"text": "banned", "start": 1.454, "end": 1.85}, {"text": "why", "start": 2.283, "end": 2.367}, {"text": "does", "start": 2.379, "end": 2.487}, {"text": "the", "start": 2.499, "end": 2.584}, {"text": "bathroom", "start": 2.596, "end": 3.028}, {"text": "have", "start": 3.04, "end": 3.172}, {"text": "an", "start": 3.184, "end": 3.245}, {"text": "ashtray", "start": 3.257, "end": 3.761}]}, {"cap": "It's not a mistake. It's required.", "start": 4.231, "end": 6.106, "audio_at": 4.171, "dur": 2.114959, "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 4.231, "end": 4.34}, {"text": "not", "start": 4.352, "end": 4.496}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.508, "end": 4.532}, {"text": "mistake", "start": 4.544, "end": 5.037}, {"text": "It's", "start": 5.433, "end": 5.541}, {"text": "required", "start": 5.553, "end": 6.106}]}, {"cap": "Aviation safety rules require an ashtray on the lavatory door.", "start": 6.526, "end": 10.144, "audio_at": 6.466, "dur": 3.857791, "words": [{"text": "Aviation", "start": 6.526, "end": 7.055}, {"text": "safety", "start": 7.067, "end": 7.5}, {"text": "rules", "start": 7.512, "end": 7.788}, {"text": "require", "start": 7.8, "end": 8.269}, {"text": "an", "start": 8.281, "end": 8.389}, {"text": "ashtray", "start": 8.401, "end": 9.014}, {"text": "on", "start": 9.11, "end": 9.183}, {"text": "the", "start": 9.195, "end": 9.267}, {"text": "lavatory", "start": 9.279, "end": 9.796}, {"text": "door", "start": 9.808, "end": 10.144}]}, {"cap": "Why? Because someone always smokes in secret.", "start": 10.614, "end": 13.174, "audio_at": 10.554, "dur": 2.800083, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 10.614, "end": 10.879}, {"text": "Because", "start": 11.287, "end": 11.552}, {"text": "someone", "start": 11.564, "end": 11.912}, {"text": "always", "start": 11.924, "end": 12.285}, {"text": "smokes", "start": 12.297, "end": 12.621}, {"text": "in", "start": 12.633, "end": 12.717}, {"text": "secret", "start": 12.73, "end": 13.174}]}, {"cap": "And without an ashtray, where do they put it out?", "start": 13.594, "end": 15.686, "audio_at": 13.534, "dur": 2.331333, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 13.594, "end": 13.654}, {"text": "without", "start": 13.666, "end": 13.955}, {"text": "an", "start": 13.967, "end": 14.039}, {"text": "ashtray", "start": 14.051, "end": 14.544}, {"text": "where", "start": 14.904, "end": 14.976}, {"text": "do", "start": 14.988, "end": 15.061}, {"text": "they", "start": 15.073, "end": 15.169}, {"text": "put", "start": 15.181, "end": 15.337}, {"text": "it", "start": 15.349, "end": 15.421}, {"text": "out", "start": 15.433, "end": 15.686}]}, {"cap": "In the bathroom trash. Full of paper.", "start": 16.106, "end": 18.173, "audio_at": 16.046, "dur": 2.307291, "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 16.106, "end": 16.166}, {"text": "the", "start": 16.178, "end": 16.25}, {"text": "bathroom", "start": 16.262, "end": 16.646}, {"text": "trash", "start": 16.658, "end": 17.139}, {"text": "Full", "start": 17.572, "end": 17.668}, {"text": "of", "start": 17.68, "end": 17.752}, {"text": "paper", "start": 17.764, "end": 18.173}]}, {"cap": "In 1973, a Brazilian plane flying from Rio to Paris caught fire right in the bathroom.", "start": 18.793, "end": 24.454, "audio_at": 18.733, "dur": 5.901042, "words": [{"text": "In 1973", "start": 18.793, "end": 20.007}, {"text": "a", "start": 20.367, "end": 20.427}, {"text": "Brazilian", "start": 20.439, "end": 20.968}, {"text": "plane", "start": 20.98, "end": 21.269}, {"text": "flying", "start": 21.281, "end": 21.629}, {"text": "from", "start": 21.641, "end": 21.834}, {"text": "Rio", "start": 21.846, "end": 22.17}, {"text": "to", "start": 22.182, "end": 22.278}, {"text": "Paris", "start": 22.29, "end": 22.699}, {"text": "caught", "start": 22.711, "end": 22.976}, {"text": "fire", "start": 22.988, "end": 23.48}, {"text": "right", "start": 23.492, "end": 23.733}, {"text": "in", "start": 23.817, "end": 23.877}, {"text": "the", "start": 23.889, "end": 23.961}, {"text": "bathroom", "start": 23.973, "end": 24.454}]}, {"cap": "The main suspect: a cigarette thrown in the trash.", "start": 24.874, "end": 27.578, "audio_at": 24.814, "dur": 2.944334, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 24.874, "end": 24.922}, {"text": "main", "start": 24.934, "end": 25.126}, {"text": "suspect", "start": 25.138, "end": 25.691}, {"text": "a", "start": 26.052, "end": 26.088}, {"text": "cigarette", "start": 26.1, "end": 26.545}, {"text": "thrown", "start": 26.557, "end": 26.881}, {"text": "in", "start": 26.893, "end": 26.953}, {"text": "the", "start": 26.965, "end": 27.025}, {"text": "trash", "start": 27.037, "end": 27.578}]}, {"cap": "More than a hundred people died.", "start": 28.098, "end": 29.384, "audio_at": 28.038, "dur": 1.526041, "words": [{"text": "More", "start": 28.098, "end": 28.23}, {"text": "than", "start": 28.242, "end": 28.339}, {"text": "a", "start": 28.351, "end": 28.387}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 28.399, "end": 28.723}, {"text": "people", "start": 28.735, "end": 29.024}, {"text": "died", "start": 29.036, "end": 29.384}]}, {"cap": "That's why the ashtray is still there.", "start": 30.154, "end": 31.693, "audio_at": 30.094, "dur": 1.778458, "words": [{"text": "That's", "start": 30.154, "end": 30.286}, {"text": "why", "start": 30.299, "end": 30.431}, {"text": "the", "start": 30.443, "end": 30.551}, {"text": "ashtray", "start": 30.563, "end": 31.008}, {"text": "is", "start": 31.02, "end": 31.116}, {"text": "still", "start": 31.128, "end": 31.392}, {"text": "there", "start": 31.404, "end": 31.693}]}, {"cap": "No one should use it… but if someone does, it can save the plane.", "start": 32.113, "end": 35.406, "audio_at": 32.053, "dur": 3.5332500000000002, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 32.113, "end": 32.233}, {"text": "one", "start": 32.245, "end": 32.365}, {"text": "should", "start": 32.377, "end": 32.545}, {"text": "use", "start": 32.557, "end": 32.798}, {"text": "it", "start": 32.81, "end": 32.954}, {"text": "but", "start": 33.255, "end": 33.387}, {"text": "if", "start": 33.399, "end": 33.483}, {"text": "someone", "start": 33.495, "end": 33.843}, {"text": "does", "start": 33.856, "end": 34.276}, {"text": "it", "start": 34.517, "end": 34.577}, {"text": "can", "start": 34.589, "end": 34.697}, {"text": "save", "start": 34.709, "end": 34.961}, {"text": "the", "start": 34.973, "end": 35.045}, {"text": "plane", "start": 35.057, "end": 35.406}]}, {"cap": "Had you ever noticed this ashtray? Tell me in the comments.", "start": 35.976, "end": 38.656, "audio_at": 35.916, "dur": 2.9202500000000002, "words": [{"text": "Had", "start": 35.976, "end": 36.096}, {"text": "you", "start": 36.108, "end": 36.204}, {"text": "ever", "start": 36.216, "end": 36.373}, {"text": "noticed", "start": 36.385, "end": 36.721}, {"text": "this", "start": 36.733, "end": 36.877}, {"text": "ashtray", "start": 36.889, "end": 37.298}, {"text": "Tell", "start": 37.695, "end": 37.803}, {"text": "me", "start": 37.815, "end": 37.911}, {"text": "in", "start": 37.923, "end": 37.983}, {"text": "the", "start": 37.995, "end": 38.067}, {"text": "comments", "start": 38.079, "end": 38.656}]}]}